			<table style="width: 100%">
			<!--
			-->
			<tr><th id="1">001.鉄二十二枚張片白星兜<br />
				　　（てつにじゅうにまいばりかたじろほしかぶと）</th></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/gekisen053.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/gekisen053_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen053.jpg" --></a><a href="img/gekisen054.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/gekisen054_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen054.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/gekisen056.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/gekisen056_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen056.jpg" --></a><a href="img/gekisen055.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/gekisen055_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen055.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">鎌倉時代後期の兜。<br />
				額の獅子や折り返し部分の絵など、美術品としての価値も高い。</td></tr>
			<!--
			-->			
			<tr><th id="2">002.鉄十枚張厳星兜<br />
				　　（てつじゅうまいばりいかぼしかぶと）</th></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/gekisen007.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/gekisen007_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen007.jpg" --></a><a href="img/gekisen013.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/gekisen013_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen013.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/gekisen009.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/gekisen009_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen009.jpg" --></a><a href="img/gekisen008.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/gekisen008_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen008.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">鎌倉時代の兜。<br />
				大きな鉄を貼り合わせて作られたそうです。</td></tr>
			<!--
			-->
			<tr><th id="3">003.黒漆塗桃形水牛脇立兜 <br />
				　　（くろうるしぬりももなりすいぎゅうわきたてかぶと）</th></tr>
			<tr><td>&nbsp;</td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">未入手</td></tr>
			<!--
			-->			
			<tr><th id="4">004.朱塗三枚張日根野兜<br />
				　　（しゅぬりさんまいばりひねのかぶと）</th></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/gekisen017.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/gekisen017_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen017.jpg" --></a><a href="img/gekisen018.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/gekisen018_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen018.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/gekisen019.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/gekisen019_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen019.jpg" --></a><a href="img/gekisen020.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/gekisen020_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen020.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">
				日根野形（ひねのなり）は兜の様式のひとつで、頭にフィットし、衝撃に強い丸みを帯びたデザインとなっています。<br />
				この兜は日根野形に鹿の角を付けたもの。</td></tr>
			<!--
			-->
			<tr><th id="5">005.蛇目紋長烏帽子型兜<br />
				　　（じゃのめもんながえぼしかたかぶと） </th></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/gekisen004.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/gekisen004_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen004.jpg" --></a><a href="img/gekisen015.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/gekisen015_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen015.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/gekisen006.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/gekisen006_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen006.jpg" --></a><a href="img/gekisen005.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/gekisen005_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen005.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">安土桃山時代につくられた、烏帽子状の兜。<br />
				自分の存在を大きく見せる効果がある。<br />
				「蛇の目」であって「日の丸」ではないです。</td></tr>
			<!--
			-->			
			<tr><th id="6">006.唐冠馬蘭後立の兜<br />
				　　（とうかんむりばりんうしろだてのかぶと）</th></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/gekisen001.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/gekisen001_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen001.jpg" --></a><a href="img/gekisen016.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/gekisen016_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen016.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/gekisen003.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/gekisen003_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen003.jpg" --></a><a href="img/gekisen002.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/gekisen002_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen002.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">豊臣秀吉の兜。<br />
				こちらのみ、何度か復刻します。</td></tr>
			<!--
			-->
			<tr><th id="7">007.金箔押一の谷形兜 <br />
				　　（きんぱくおしいちのたになりかぶと）</th></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/gekisen025.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/gekisen025_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen025.jpg" --></a><a href="img/gekisen026.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/gekisen026_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen026.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/gekisen028.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/gekisen028_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen028.jpg" --></a><a href="img/gekisen027.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/gekisen027_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen027.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">左右に広がる板状の装飾を持つ兜を「一の谷形」と呼ぶ。</td></tr>
			<!--
			-->			
			<tr><th id="8">008.紫糸威白熊兜 <br />
				　　（むらさきいとおどししろくまかぶと）</th></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/gekisen049.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/gekisen049_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen049.jpg" --></a><a href="img/gekisen050.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/gekisen050_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen050.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/gekisen052.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/gekisen052_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen052.jpg" --></a><a href="img/gekisen051.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/gekisen051_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen051.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">「紫糸威」は首周りの紫色の糸をさし、「白熊」は白く染められた熊の糸を指します。<br />
				No.001の鎌倉時代の兜では額の装飾が獅子でしたが、やがて鬼の面に変化していきます。<br />
				武田信玄の絵にも使用されています。</td></tr>
			<!--
			-->
			<tr><th id="9">009.三鍬形阿古陀形筋兜<br />
				　　（みつくわがたあこだなりすじかぶと）</th></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/gekisen029.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/gekisen029_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen029.jpg" --></a><a href="img/gekisen030.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/gekisen030_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen030.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/gekisen032.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/gekisen032_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen032.jpg" --></a><a href="img/gekisen031.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/gekisen031_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen031.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/gekisen033.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/gekisen033_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen033.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">「阿古陀形」（あこだなり）と呼ばれるタイプの兜。<br />
				武田信玄もこのような形の兜を付けていたといわれています。</td></tr>
			<!--
			-->			
			<tr><th id="10">010.三宝荒神兜<br />
				　　（さんぽうこうじんのかぶと）</th></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/gekisen034.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/gekisen034_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen034.jpg" --></a><a href="img/gekisen035.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/gekisen035_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen035.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/gekisen036.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/gekisen036_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen036.jpg" --></a><a href="img/gekisen037.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/gekisen037_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen037.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/gekisen038.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/gekisen038_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen038.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">三宝荒神（さんぽうこうじん）とは三つの顔を持つ、仏教の信仰対象。<br />
				上杉謙信がこの兜を持っていたと言われています。</td></tr>
			<!--
			-->
			<tr><th id="11">011.鉄打出し銀箔押兎形兜<br />
				　　（てつうちだしぎんぱくおしうさぎなりかぶと）</th></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/gekisen021.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/gekisen021_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen021.jpg" --></a><a href="img/gekisen022.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/gekisen022_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen022.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/gekisen023.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/gekisen023_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen023.jpg" --></a><a href="img/gekisen024.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/gekisen024_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/gekisen/img/gekisen024.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">室町時代後期から「変わり兜」と呼ばれる、変わった装飾の兜が造られるようになりました。<br />
				この兜はウサギが乗っています。</td></tr>
